# A done card is drawn as done: the done marker and the checked box (check glyph) appear together, an open card has neither
# Strikethrough and inkMuted-on-surfaceDone are set in ItemCard.ets (LineThrough decoration, inkMuted font, RetroCard done) and are not readable from the layout tree
launch
tap text "Groceries"
expect count id "item.done" 1
expect count text "✓" 1
expect count id "item.open" 2
tap text "Bread"
expect count id "item.done" 2
expect count text "✓" 2
expect count id "item.open" 1
tap text "Bread"
expect count id "item.done" 1
expect count text "✓" 1
expect count id "item.open" 2
